        {
            "id": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/about-rob/",
            "url": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/about-rob/",
            "title": "About Rob",
            "summary": "For the past 16+ years I have helped physical AI companies through the hardest transition they will face: R&amp;D &gt;&gt; real deployable product &gt;&gt; scale. How I lead: Low ego, teacher, and elevator. I teach instead of dictate, because a team given responsibility outperforms one&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For the past 16+ years I have helped physical AI companies through the hardest transition they will face: R&amp;D &gt;&gt; real deployable product &gt;&gt; scale.</span></p>\n<p><strong>How I lead:</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Low ego, teacher, and elevator. I teach instead of dictate, because a team given responsibility outperforms one that just follows orders. I lead alongside my team: doing the work with them. My passion is to find team members opportunities to grow and make sure they get seen for it. This is what motivates me.</span></p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/9/gallery/Screenshot-From-2026-09-23-21-34-25.png\" data-size=\"819x750\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/9/gallery/Screenshot-From-2026-09-23-21-34-25-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"703\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/9/gallery/Screenshot-From-2026-09-23-21-34-40.png\" data-size=\"1025x771\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/9/gallery/Screenshot-From-2026-09-23-21-34-40-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"578\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p><strong>Pastimes (too many)</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Photography: <a href=\"http://www.brownphotographic.com\">www.brownphotographic.com</a></li>\n<li>Open Source Software: <a href=\"https://github.com/brownphotographic/\">https://github.com/brownphotographic/</a></li>\n<li>Restoring old tractors: <a href=\"https://adventureswithadeere.blogspot.com/\">https://adventureswithadeere.blogspot.com/</a></li>\n<li>Former glider pilot</li>\n</ul>",
            "image": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/9/20240203_20240203_153818-VSCO-2xl.jpg",
