        {
            "id": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/kodiak-ai/",
            "url": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/kodiak-ai/",
            "title": "Kodiak AI",
            "summary": "As Head of Product at Kodiak, I helped build and launch the world's first driverless commercial trucking fleet, now running 24/7 in the Permian Basin. I am currently leading Product for Kodiak Defense, applying that same autonomy stack to ground autonomy programs for the US&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As Head of Product at Kodiak, I helped build and launch the world's first driverless commercial trucking fleet, now running 24/7 in the Permian Basin. I am currently leading Product for Kodiak Defense, applying that same autonomy stack to ground autonomy programs for the US Army, US Marines, and NATO. I help build and nurture close partnerships with major defense primes and OEMs including Textron, GDLS, and US vehicle OEMs.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Kodiak </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">‐ </span><strong>Head of Product, Defense</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2025 - Present</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Driving product management for military ground robotics for US Army, US Marines, and NATO countries.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Supporting business development, commercial and technical partnerships with leading defense primes and suppliers. </span></li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/3KNRxE4moCE?si=NEW84dX8AO4bb0xC\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/9g5r9SkKvUU\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>\n<p><strong>Kodiak </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">‐ </span><strong>Head of Product</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Autonomous Trucking for Commercial, and Industrial</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2022 - 2025</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Lead and grew Product and Technical Program Management teams for Level 4 Class 8 self driving trucking.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Working directly with customers to understand existing processes and develop custom solutions.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/bwrZV-s2_HM?si=k6nFP4bn6CtxqEyh\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Lc2SMma-urk?si=7kXoPtJ4TcK6K1yu\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>",
            "image": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/3/PXL_20250115_231927917-2.jpg",
            "author": {
                "name": "Rob Brown"
            },
