        },
        {
            "id": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/motional-aptiv-nutonomy/",
            "url": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/motional-aptiv-nutonomy/",
            "title": "Motional / Aptiv / nuTonomy",
            "summary": "I joined nuTonomy as its first Product Manager (around the time of its acquisition by Delphi/Aptiv) helping the R&amp;D heavy team ship its first driverless product. As Senior Product Director at the resulting Motional, I led product and industrial design for our first driver-out robotaxi&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I joined nuTonomy as its first Product Manager (around the time of its acquisition by Delphi/Aptiv) helping the R&amp;D heavy team ship its first driverless product. As Senior Product Director at the resulting Motional, I led product and industrial design for our first driver-out robotaxi deployment (2021), and partnered with Hyundai in South Korea to co-develop the award winning IONIQ 5 robotaxi.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Motional</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> - </span><strong>Senior Product Director</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Level 4 Robotaxi and Last Mile Delivery in Las Vegas &amp; LA</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2020 – 2022</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Lead Industrial Design and UX prototyping, to design and produce the Motional Ioniq 5 Robotaxi with Hyundai.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Lead requirements and market analysis for Level 4 automation and B2B integration with Lyft and Uber.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Article:</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/articles/motional-previews-the-self-driving-taxi-experience-with-lyft-as-its-first-partner-11634243135?reflink=desktopwebshare_permalink\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">WSJ Robotaxi user experience</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span></p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/4/gallery/motional_ioniq_5.jpg\" data-size=\"1133x632\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/4/gallery/motional_ioniq_5-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"428\"></a>\n<figcaption>Hyundai Ioniq 5 Robotaxi</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/4/gallery/motionalunlock.png\" data-size=\"1089x602\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/4/gallery/motionalunlock-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"425\"></a>\n<figcaption>Motional Passenger UX</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/4/gallery/motional-driverless-2021.jpg\" data-size=\"2560x1708\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/4/gallery/motional-driverless-2021-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\"></a>\n<figcaption>Driverless Launch 2021</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/u6gWGQ0wH0M\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>\n<p><strong>nuTonomy </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">- </span><strong>Senior Product Manager</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:</span><strong> </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Level 4 Robotaxi (Boston, Singapore, and Las Vegas)</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2018 - 2020 </span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Product strategy, requirements and product development to move from R&amp;D to first driverless product in 2020.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Technical partnerships including Tier 1, 2 and OEMs (BMW, FCA, Hyundai and component suppliers).</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Collaboration with customers (e.g. Lyft, Uber, Grab, Via) to create custom solutions and define system integrations</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/4/gallery/lyft-aptiv.jpg\" data-size=\"1500x600\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/4/gallery/lyft-aptiv-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"307\"></a>\n<figcaption>Aptiv Robotaxi with Lyft paid customers</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/4/gallery/nutonomy-singapore.jpg\" data-size=\"1024x576\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/4/gallery/nutonomy-singapore-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a>\n<figcaption>nuTonomy Singapore - Renault Zoe</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/FlsvH9bGNE8\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/IV2Yke1YGmw\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>",
            "image": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/4/motional_ioniq_5.jpg",
            "author": {
                "name": "Rob Brown"
            },
            "tags": [
