        {
            "id": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/cyphy-works/",
            "url": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/cyphy-works/",
            "title": "CyPhy Works",
            "summary": "I was VP of Product at CyPhy Works, building autonomous ISR drones for the US Army and Navy SOCOM: my first experience taking a defense product from R&amp;D to fielded, wartime use. Unfortunately the company was in financial trouble already when I joined and shuttered&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I was VP of Product at CyPhy Works, building autonomous ISR drones for the US Army and Navy SOCOM: my first experience taking a defense product from R&amp;D to fielded, wartime use. Unfortunately the company was in financial trouble already when I joined and shuttered shortly following my departure.</span></p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/5/gallery/cyphyworks.png\" data-size=\"1105x736\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/5/gallery/cyphyworks-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\"></a>\n<figcaption>PARC Tethered Defense Drone</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/5/gallery/cyphydeliveryups.png\" data-size=\"1150x745\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/5/gallery/cyphydeliveryups-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"498\"></a>\n<figcaption>Cyphy hexcopter delivery drone for UPS</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>\n<p><strong>CyPhy Works</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> - </span><strong>Vice President of Product 2017 - 2018</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Product Development &amp; Strategy for PARC - <span class=\"kY2IgmnCmOGjharHErah N56cWZpP8cNJu1dqgCxB\"> Persistent Aerial Reconnaissance and Communications - drone</span> ISR, communications relay, and delivery drones.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Supported BD with US Army &amp; Navy special forces (SOCOM), Red Cross, Police, Customs &amp; Border Patrol, UPS.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"770\" height=\"432\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/vKlRddLqvEY\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"770\" height=\"432\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/aEECe5sFJms\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>",
            "image": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/5/20170919_13-08-34-2.jpg",
            "author": {
                "name": "Rob Brown"
            },
            "tags": [
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-09-19T21:00:00-04:00",
            "date_modified": "2026-09-23T23:36:33-04:00"
        },
        {
            "id": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/kiva-systems-amazon-robotics/",
            "url": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/kiva-systems-amazon-robotics/",
            "title": "Kiva Systems / Amazon Robotics",
            "summary": "I was on the founding product team at Kiva Systems, building the robotic warehouse systems that Amazon acquired for $775M, which became the backbone of Amazon Robotics. I helped scale that technology across Amazon's fulfillment network: cutting costs, deploying new robotics systems, and increasing performance&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I was on the founding product team at Kiva Systems, building the robotic warehouse systems that Amazon acquired for $775M, which became the backbone of Amazon Robotics. I helped scale that technology across Amazon's fulfillment network: cutting costs, deploying new robotics systems, and increasing performance (1M+ bots deployed globally today). We succeeded with a low ego, high execution team, inspired and trusted to deliver. I led a team of product managers, mechanical engineers, and TPMs.</span></p>\n<p><strong>Product Manager,</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Kiva Systems (pre Amazon.com acquisition)</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2010 – 2012</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Requirements and human-machine interface design for pioneering warehouse robotics solution.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Direct engagement / boots on ground  with customers including Diapers.com, The Gap for product feedback.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/6/gallery/kivacommercial.png\" data-size=\"1244x727\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/6/gallery/kivacommercial-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"449\"></a>\n<figcaption>Kiva System in customer warehouse - pre Amazon Acquisition</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/6/gallery/kivaamazon.png\" data-size=\"1174x659\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/6/gallery/kivaamazon-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"431\"></a>\n<figcaption>Kiva deployment in Amazon Fulfillment Center</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>\n<p><strong>Senior Technical Product Manager,</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Amazon Robotics</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2012 – 2013</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Design and development of Amazon’s first Kiva-enabled robotics fulfillment centers. Customer: Amazon Global Operations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"336\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Jh27vjAhE-c\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>\n<p><strong>Product Management and TPM Team Lead,</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Automation &amp; Robotics Advanced Programs (XB-15)</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2013 – 2017</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Next-gen warehouse robotics and automation including Kiva Systems robotics, AS&amp;RS and robotic arms. </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Solution design &amp; deployment of full scale building automation (1M sq ft), and hands-on support through peak operations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/6/gallery/amazonbdl1.png\" data-size=\"1075x604\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/6/gallery/amazonbdl1-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a>\n<figcaption>BDL1 1 million square foot DC with wall to wall automation</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/6/gallery/amazonBDL1launch.jpg\" data-size=\"1267x471\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/6/gallery/amazonBDL1launch-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"285\"></a>\n<figcaption>BDL1 launch team, 2015</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/6/gallery/bdl1bot.png\" data-size=\"973x648\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/6/gallery/bdl1bot-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"511\"></a>\n<figcaption>Kiva robot in BDL1, 2015</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/6/gallery/bdl1-pick.png\" data-size=\"1204x801\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/6/gallery/bdl1-pick-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"511\"></a>\n<figcaption>Amazon warehouse worker, BDL1</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Jh27vjAhE-c\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/8gy5tYVR-28\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>\n<figure class=\"post__video\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/szU2-1infqc\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></figure>",
            "image": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/6/20130222_11-11-03.jpg",
            "author": {
                "name": "Rob Brown"
            },
