            "date_published": "2026-09-19T20:00:00-04:00",
            "date_modified": "2026-09-23T23:36:22-04:00"
        },
        {
            "id": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/prior-roles/",
            "url": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/prior-roles/",
            "title": "GIS / Mapping Roles (UK)",
            "summary": "GIS Analyst, Product Manager, BT Global Access - 2002 - 2007 GIS Consultant, Pavement Engineering Org serving UK Highways agencies 2001-2002 Mapping systems development, and map creation to support major UK managed motortway networks. Supported the first smart motorway network coupling real time traffic sensing&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p><strong>GIS Analyst, Product Manager, BT Global Access  - 2002 - 2007</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">GIS and database modeling for commercial Access (broadband) pricing across 25 global countries down to street level.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Competitive pricing analysis for pricing policies, working with global account managers and product managers to set pricing for networks. </span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Promoted to Product Manager to drive specifications for real-time global access pricing engine.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/7/gallery/accessconcept.png\" data-size=\"445x441\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/7/gallery/accessconcept-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"445\" height=\"441\"></a>\n<figcaption>Global City Access Postcodes</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/7/gallery/accessconcept2.png\" data-size=\"319x298\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/7/gallery/accessconcept2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"319\" height=\"298\"></a>\n<figcaption>Global access networks</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>\n<p><strong>GIS Consultant, Pavement Engineering Org serving UK Highways agencies 2001-2002</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"2\">Mapping systems development, and map creation to support major UK managed motortway networks.</li>\n<li aria-level=\"2\">Supported the first smart motorway network coupling real time traffic sensing and monitoring with dynamic speed limits to reduce delays, accidents and improve traffic flow. </li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Initiated GIS for M25 online web enabled tool for operations teams, created vector network topology from self-commissioned aerial survey.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trained GIS technicians in Perth, Scotland to digitize road network for national truck-based road condition survey</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/7/gallery/m25.png\" data-size=\"1342x722\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/7/gallery/m25-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"413\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/7/gallery/m25sphere.png\" data-size=\"737x654\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/7/gallery/m25sphere-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"737\" height=\"654\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/7/gallery/unnamed.png\" data-size=\"861x573\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/7/gallery/unnamed-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"511\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>",
            "image": "https://brownphotographjic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/7/m25.png",
